{"availability":"available","full":"Luanafrtd/launchkit","name":"launchkit","description":"Gives freelancers and agencies a client-ready website demo to pitch with, before any real design work starts. Next.js 15, Auth.js, Prisma, swappable content provider.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-18T15:52:05Z","updated":"2026-08-22T13:44:16Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://launchkit-ai-nine.vercel.app","topics":["authjs","nextjs","portfolio-project","prisma","react","saas","shadcn-ui","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://launchkit-ai-nine.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.422Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.422Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.422Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.422Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Generate a client-ready website demo in minutes: something concrete to put in front of a prospect before any real design or development work begins.","📄 Read the case study: architecture decisions, real bugs hit, and how each was diagnosed and fixed.","Note on the live demo: this project isn't currently deployed. It runs locally in about a minute with zero setup. See Getting Started below."],"features":["3-step project wizard: business info → template → review & generate","7 industry templates: Real Estate, Gym/Fitness, Dental Clinic, Restaurant, Law Firm, Consultant, Local Business, each with a genuinely different hero layout, section order, and visual theme, decoupled from industry so…","Live visual editor: edit headlines, descriptions, services, FAQs, and CTA text with the preview updating on every keystroke; regenerate at any time while keeping the chosen template","Responsive preview: desktop/tablet/mobile toggle before you ever share the link","Shareable public link: every project gets an unauthenticated /demo/[slug] page, clearly labeled as an AI-generated demo concept, ready to send to a client"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Luanafrtd/launchkit/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"40ba6c299d232a2cca26b3acd5df4768e230029139fa539e8a1041fb5c4846b8","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.536Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.536Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Generate a client-ready website demo in minutes: something concrete to put in front of a prospect before any real design or development work begins.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Luanafrtd/launchkit/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"It works entirely out of the box: a built-in content engine writes real, varied copy per industry with no API key required, and a real LLM (OpenAI or Anthropic) can be swapped in later behind an environment variable with no code changes: useful, but never a requirement to use the product.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Luanafrtd/launchkit/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Authentication: email/password signup, plus a one-click demo account so anyone can try it without registering","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Luanafrtd/launchkit/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"A demo tool that requires an API key before a prospect (or a recruiter) can try it creates unnecessary friction.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Luanafrtd/launchkit/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"9 end-to-end tests across 3 files (Playwright) cover demo login, signup, route protection, sign-out, full project creation → generation, live editing with persistence, and the public shareable demo link.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Luanafrtd/launchkit/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"40ba6c299d232a2cca26b3acd5df4768e230029139fa539e8a1041fb5c4846b8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Luanafrtd/launchkit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T